# Shark Bite phone rotation + black screen

- Catalog chomp keeps default `videoRotationDeg: 90` (sideways pixels in `blue_gel_power.mp4`).
- Local uploads use `rotationSource: "local"` → 0° unless `_userSetChompRotation` (set when Lab rotation slider changes).
- Pass `rotationSource` into `getSharkBiteVideoRotationDeg` / `ChromaKeyVideo`.
- Never put a black layer *under* the chroma canvas (stuck black when shark keyed out / off-frame). Blackout only via top overlay; clear on `fireComplete`, beat error, and `!active`.

## Verification
- Phone local upload bite: shark upright; screen returns to game after FX
- Catalog bite: still upright with 90°
- Lab rotation slider sets `_userSetChompRotation`
